  "description": "The Langma Advanced SL is engineered with our lightest composite frame material to take you to the next-level of road riding. The ultra-light frame is an ally on the steepest climbs, and the slender tubing gives an aerodynamic advantage. The downtube tapers to a thicker square-shape at the PowerCore bottom bracket, which creates an extremely lightweight and fast racing machine, without compromising strength or pedal stiffness. With Liv’s 3F design philosophy and cutting-edge aerodynamic innovations on a compact frame design, this nimble and strong bike provides the winning advantage on every effort, from mountainous road races to aggressive criteriums. Langma Advanced SL is now offered in the QOM version, with a 34T cassette and compact crank you can spin up those steeps and snatch that coveted crown.",
